# CNN serving checkpoints ship with the repo via Git LFS so the default
# classifier(s) work right after `git clone` + `git lfs pull` (or with the LFS
# client installed). The repo only stores <2 KB pointer files; GitHub LFS holds
# the actual weights (each file stays well below the 2 GB per-file limit).
# Any other model weight (re-training output, helpers) is intentionally kept
# out of the repo (see .gitignore).
checkpoints/*.pth filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text